KABUSHIKI KAISYA ADVANCE</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>SUGAI, YASUHISA</name></addressbook></applicant></applicants><inventors><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>SUGAI YASUHISA</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>SUGAI, YASUHISA</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>A method of processing a duplicate, comprising the steps of dividing a lump material to be processed into a plurality of processing ranges, rough-processing it to a proximate, enlarged or offset shape desired for each processing range, and finish-processing it to a target shape based on these processings, whereby the processing of miniature duplicates is enabled.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>L'invention concerne un procédé de traitement d'une reproduction, ce procédé consistant tout d'abord à soumettre un matériau en morceaux, destiné à être traité, à plusieurs étapes de traitement permettant de conférer à ce matériau la forme approximative, grossière, ou décalée adaptée à chaque étape de traitement. Ce procédé consiste enfin en une étape de traitement par finissage permettant de donner audit matériau sa forme définitive suite aux différents traitements susmentionnés, ce qui permet donc de traiter des reproductions miniatures.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_l